0010:R; 
1110:breakdown
1111:IN Vain";
CM_ SG_ 181 Demand_Speed "The positive or negative of the speed indicates the direction of the motor rotation (positive in the same direction as the normal rotation direction of the engine)";
CM_ SG_ 181 Demand_Torque "The positive and negative torque indicates the direction of the force, and specifies that the direction of engine rotation is positive.";
